### 11. Create live session
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Introduction to Artificial Intelligence",
  "description": "An introduction to the core concepts of AI, machine learning and neural networks.",
  "startTime": "{{$isoTimestamp}}",
  "endTime": "2030-12-31T23:59:59Z",
  "type": "Conference",
  "capacity": 100,
  "eventId": "{{eventAiId}}",
  "roomId": {{roomAmphitheaterAId}},
  "image": "/images/sessions/ai-introduction.jpg"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("sessionLiveId", response.body.id);
%}


### 12. Create future session
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Hybrid Cloud and Scalability",
  "description": "Best practices for designing scalable, resilient and secure cloud infrastructure.",
  "startTime": "2030-01-10T10:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2030-01-10T11:00:00Z",
  "type": "Workshop",
  "capacity": 80,
  "eventId": "{{eventAiId}}",
  "roomId": {{roomWorkshopLabId}},
  "image": "/images/sessions/cloud-hybrid.jpg"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("sessionCloudId", response.body.id);
%}


### 13. Create cybersecurity session
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Cybersecurity for Modern Applications",
  "description": "A practical approach to securing web applications, APIs and critical systems.",
  "startTime": "2030-01-10T11:15:00Z",
  "endTime": "2030-01-10T12:15:00Z",
  "type": "Conference",
  "capacity": 90,
  "eventId": "{{eventTechId}}",
  "roomId": {{roomBId}},
  "image": "/images/sessions/cybersecurity.jpg"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("sessionCyberId", response.body.id);
%}


### 14. Assign Alexandre to live session
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionLiveId}}/speakers/{{speakerAlexandreId}}


### 15. Assign Nadia to live session
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionLiveId}}/speakers/{{speakerNadiaId}}


### 16. Assign Sophie to cloud session
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionCloudId}}/speakers/{{speakerSophieId}}


### 17. Assign Karim to cybersecurity session
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionCyberId}}/speakers/{{speakerKarimId}}


### 18. Create question 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionLiveId}}/questions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "What are the main use cases of generative AI today?",
  "authorName": "Lucas"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("questionOneId", response.body.id);
%}


